<ontology/use_leather_tanning/use_leather_tanning__0275__q2/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Products of the Vegetable Kingdom (1854; Project Gutenberg #15191), section BARKS FOR TANNING" ;
